  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Word reaches the office that the devastated young actress has left Tokyo to live quietly in the countryside. As Muranishi sits weighed down by guilt, Toshi urges him not to stall out—right before Kawada bursts through the door. Listen to Muranishi, Toshi, and Kawada in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "田舎に帰ったらしい。しばらくひっそりと暮らすって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "やっと売れるもん作れたのによ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おいおっさん、明日の集合時間だけどよ…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "そんなに落ち込んでてもしかたねえだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "俺たちは止まれねえんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあ、とりあえず撮ってかねえとな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かってる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "村西さん、大変だ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうしました？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "次の撮影に来るはずだった女優が、いきなりキャンセルになりました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "えっ、バックレか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "いや、それが違うみたいなんです。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "田舎に帰ったらしい。しばらくひっそりと暮らすって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Apparently she went back to the countryside and plans to live quietly out of sight for a while.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "やっと売れるもん作れたのによ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Damn it, right when we finally made something that actually sells!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おいおっさん、明日の集合時間だけどよ…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey boss, about tomorrow morning's call time...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "そんなに落ち込んでてもしかたねえだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sitting around beating yourself up like this won't change a thing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "俺たちは止まれねえんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Guys like us can't afford to stop moving.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあ、とりあえず撮ってかねえとな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For now we just have to keep shooting, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かってる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "村西さん、大変だ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Muranishi, we have an emergency!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうしました？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "次の撮影に来るはずだった女優が、いきなりキャンセルになりました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The actress scheduled for our next shoot suddenly canceled out of nowhere.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "えっ、バックレか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What — did she flake out on us?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "いや、それが違うみたいなんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, it looks like something else entirely is going on.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
